    <h1 class="h-hero mt-5">Against the <mark style="background:#C0392B;color:#FBEAEA">war</mark></h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg sm:text-xl text-muted max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">Elysium+ was founded in Chernihiv, Ukraine, in 2020. Since February 2022, Russia's full-scale invasion has killed civilians, occupied towns, and destroyed homes and infrastructure across our home region. This page states our position plainly and backs every claim with a source you can check yourself.</p>
  </div>
